WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.102
Blood curdling scream and then a boom.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.003
That's what the man

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:03.636
suing actress

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:04.771
Gwyneth Paltrow says happened

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.840
when she slammed into him on a ski slope.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.173
Paltrow

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.375
describing a very different version

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.310
of events, saying he plowed into her

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.079
Veronica Miracle is OUTFRONT

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:14.881
this morning.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.083
Actress and businesswoman Gwyneth Paltrow

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:19.219
back in court today for a civil trial

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.488
as the man suing her over a 2016

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:23.590
skiing accident took the stand

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.824
Something I've never heard of

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:25.892
the ski resort.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.828
And that was a blood curdling scream.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.064
It was like

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.932
somebody who was out of control

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.801
and gurney hit a tree

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.603
and was going to die.

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.204
Terry Sanderson insists

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.373
Paltrow skied into him on a beginner

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.509
ski slope at a Utah ski resort,

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.477
causing him severe brain damage

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.745
and other injuries.

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:47.947
But Paltrow vehemently denies this.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:49.149
She's countersuing

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:52.052
Sanderson and claims he crashed into her.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:53.720
I said,

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.356
You ski directly into my F-ing back.

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.892
I apologize for my bad language.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:01.561
I'm like living another life now.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.763
I can't ski anymore.

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:05.065
I was told

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.100
that if I did and had another crash,

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.470
that I could wind up full time.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.972
Full time in a nursing home.

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:14.808
Animations produced by Paltrow's

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:16.609
legal team were shown to the court

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.344
to illustrate where Paltrow family

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:20.847
ski instructor Erik Christianson alleged

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:22.682
the parties were on the slope that day.

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:23.450
Christiansen,

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:24.918
who was with Paltrow's children

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.252
at the time of the accident,

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.954
testified about what he heard

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:31.458
and saw that the first he was apologizing

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.393
Then he also

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:34.761
made a statement about

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.963
she just appeared in front of me.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.131
Christensen also

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:39.799
denied Sanderson's accusation

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.401
that he and Paltrow skied away

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:43.169
without offering any assistance

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.337
to Sanderson.

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:44.971
The whole time

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.606
I'm removing skis

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.074
and getting ready to help them

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:50.176
up, I'm asking, Are you okay?

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.644
He was firm.

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:52.846
He said yes.

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:54.047
Last week, Paltrow

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:55.081
described the crash

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:57.083
in an entirely different way,

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:58.284
even calling she

00:01:58.284 --> 00:01:58.685
at first

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:00.954
thought she was being sexually assaulted.

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:02.322
I was skiing

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:04.891
and two skis came between my skis,

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:06.826
forcing my legs apart.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.761
And then there was a body

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.263
pressing against me.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.831
And there was a very strange

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:13.466
grunting noise.

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.602
I thought, Am I?

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.203
Is this a practical joke?

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:18.605
Is someone, like, doing

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:20.573
something perverted really?

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:24.811
And Paltrow's husband and two kids

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.546
were supposed to take the stand today,

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:28.748
but this trial is running behind.

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:29.916
In fact, the defense says

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.384
they may not have time

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:32.685
to get to Paltrow's family

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:35.054
and get them on the stand Aaron.

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:37.257
All right, Veronica, thank you very much.

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:37.857
Surprising.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:39.125
We'll have to continue to follow that.

